  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mining for the Energy Transition (MET): Securing a sustainable supply of critical minerals for advancing regional development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overarching objective of this program is to facilitate the attainment of SDGs 13, 17, 1, and 8 by harnessing the potential of the mining sector and its associated value chains in Argentina, Bolivia, Brazil, Chile, and Ecuador. The programme aims to contribute significantly to global decarbonization efforts and the realization of global climate and sustainable development objectives, positioning LAC as a responsible supplier of the minerals and metals crucial to the renewable technologies necessary for the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
